 "headline": "Hunter Pickup Carries MONSTARS Past Thug Life",
 "notes": [
  "Shai Gilgeous-Alexander dropped 38 points, four threes and seven dimes for Adam Silver Dez Nuts, from a bench slot, while the manager was already up 8-1.",
  "Jaden McDaniels hung 34 points, 10 boards and four threes on the MONSTARS, and Thug Life still trail 7-4 because the supporting cast went missing.",
  "Ryan Kalkbrenner left Nova Knicks a blank line tonight. Whoever dropped him for Brayden Burries at BrookynDynasty is laughing, and the Knicks are still holding the empty bag.",
  "Svi Mykhailiuk went 1-for-7 and Anfernee Simons 1-for-3 for LeParth James. Both are fresh pickups, and the 7-4 lead survived in spite of them.",
  "Scottie Barnes and Tyler Herro combined for 63 points, 12 assists and eight threes for MONSTARS, who finished the night ranked first among all twelve teams."
 ],
